<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle November inflation falls to 1.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Basle November inflation falls to 1.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Basle, Switzerland's second biggest city, fell 0.1 percent in November from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 1.0 percent, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996	Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct	+0.2 pct	0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+1.0 pct	+1.1 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  103.9	   104.0	   102.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
